# Git remote for this dossier

The only GitHub remote for this project is **https://github.com/PineappleAGI/Skill71717-Dossier**.

- `git remote origin` must be `https://github.com/PineappleAGI/Skill71717-Dossier.git`.
- Push feature branches to `origin`. Open PRs into `main` on that repo. Do not push or force-push `main` unless the user explicitly asks.
- Never push to `KingHenryZ/Skill-Dossier` or add it back as `origin`.
